<title>FRANCE: France Telecom Wanadoo has 35,000 clients.</title>
<headline>France Telecom Wanadoo has 35,000 clients.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom said on Thursday that its Wanadoo computer online service had after one year of existence attracted 35,000 paying subscribers and the number was rising by more than 6,000 per month.</p>
</text>
